/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Provable\040Data\040Possession\040at\040Untrusted\040Stores\056)
/Author (Giuseppe\040Ateniese\054\040Randal\040Burns\054\040Reza\040Curtmola\054\040Joseph\040Herring\054\040Lea\040Kissner\054\040Zachary\040N\056\040J\056\040Peterson\054\040Dawn\040Song)
/Subject (We\040introduce\040a\040model\040for\040provable\040data\040possession\040\050PDP\051\040that\040allows\040a\040client\040that\040has\040stored\040data\040at\040an\040untrusted\040server\040to\040verify\040that\040the\040server\040possesses\040the\040original\040data\040without\040retrieving\040it\056\040The\040model\040generates\040probabilistic\040proofs\040of\040possession\040by\040sampling\040random\040sets\040of\040blocks\040from\040the\040server\054\040which\040drastically\040reduces\040I\057O\040costs\056\040The\040client\040maintains\040a\040constant\040amount\040of\040metadata\040to\040verify\040the\040proof\056\040The\040challenge\057response\040protocol\040transmits\040a\040small\054\040constant\040amount\040of\040data\054\040which\040minimizes\040network\040communication\056\040Thus\054\040the\040PDP\040model\040for\040remote\040data\040checking\040supports\040large\040data\040sets\040in\040widely\055distributed\040storage\040systems\056\040We\040present\040two\040provably\055secure\040PDP\040schemes\040that\040are\040more\040efficient\040than\040previous\040solutions\054\040even\040when\040compared\040with\040schemes\040that\040achieve\040weaker\040guarantees\056\040In\040particular\054\040the\040overhead\040at\040the\040server\040is\040low\040\050or\040even\040constant\051\054\040as\040opposed\040to\040linear\040in\040the\040size\040of\040the\040data\056\040Experiments\040using\040our\040implementation\040verify\040the\040practicality\040of\040PDP\040and\040reveal\040that\040the\040performance\040of\040PDP\040is\040bounded\040by\040disk\040I\057O\040and\040not\040by\040cryptographic\040computation\056)
/Keywords (01\040Jan\0402007\054\040IACR\040Cryptology\040ePrint\040Archive\054\040Overhead\040\050computing\051)
>>
